","signature_end_line":83,"used_by":["Breakdown.SteadyCert.ChainInternal.heldZero_holds","Breakdown.SteadyCert.certificateWeakProfile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldZero"],"uses":["Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.heldRadius","Breakdown.SteadyCert.IsFracCert","Breakdown.SteadyCert.box"],"written":"HeldZeroStatement"},{"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"dependency_source":"lean_report","doc":null,"end_line":91,"kind":"def","line":88,"module":"Breakdown.FracCert.StHeld","name":"Breakdown.SteadyCert.HeldNonzeroStatement","namespace":"Breakdown.SteadyCert","noncomputable":false,"noncomputable_section":true,"private":false,"proof_used_by":[],"proof_uses":[],"protected":false,"short":"HeldNonzeroStatement","signature_end_line":88,"sorry":false,"statement_used_by":["Breakdown.SteadyCert.ChainInternal.heldNonzero_holds","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldNonzero","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile_of","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile_of_power"],"statement_uses":["Breakdown.Space","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.IsHeldSolution","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.heldRadius","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.profile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.radius","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.size","Breakdown.SteadyCert.IsFracCert","Breakdown.SteadyCert.box"],"used_by":["Breakdown.SteadyCert.ChainInternal.heldNonzero_holds","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldNonzero","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile_of","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile_of_power"],"uses":["Breakdown.Space","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.IsHeldSolution","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.heldRadius","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.profile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.radius","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.size","Breakdown.SteadyCert.IsFracCert","Breakdown.SteadyCert.box"],"written":"HeldNonzeroStatement"},{"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"dependency_source":"lean_report","doc":null,"end_line":96,"kind":"def","line":93,"module":"Breakdown.FracCert.StHeld","name":"Breakdown.SteadyCert.HeldWeakProfileStatement","namespace":"Breakdown.SteadyCert","noncomputable":false,"noncomputable_section":true,"private":false,"proof_used_by":[],"proof_uses":[],"protected":false,"short":"HeldWeakProfileStatement","signature_end_line":93,"sorry":false,"statement_used_by":["Breakdown.SteadyCert.ChainInternal.heldWeakProfile_holds","Breakdown.SteadyCert.certificateWeakProfile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile_of","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile_of_power"],"statement_uses":["Breakdown.FracCert.WeakRotatingProfileExists","Breakdown.Space","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.IsHeldSolution","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.heldMultiplier","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.heldRadius","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.radius","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.size","Breakdown.SteadyCert.IsFracCert","Breakdown.SteadyCert.box"],"used_by":["Breakdown.SteadyCert.ChainInternal.heldWeakProfile_holds","Breakdown.SteadyCert.certificateWeakProfile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile_of","Breakdown.SteadyCert.heldWeakProfile_of_power"],"uses":["Breakdown.FracCert.WeakRotatingProfileExists","Breakdown.Space","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.IsHeldSolution","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.heldMultiplier","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.heldRadius","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.radius","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertData.size","Breakdown.SteadyCert.IsFracCert","Breakdown.SteadyCert.box"],"written":"HeldWeakProfileStatement"},{"axioms":["propext","Classical.choice","Quot.sound"],"dependency_source":"lean_report","doc":null,"end_line":99,"kind":"def","line":98,"module":"Breakdown.FracCert.StHeld","name":"Breakdown.SteadyCert.CertificateWeakProfileStatement","namespace":"Breakdown.SteadyCert","noncomputable":false,"noncomputable_section":true,"private":false,"proof_used_by":[],"proof_uses":[],"protected":false,"short":"CertificateWeakProfileStatement","signature_end_line":98,"sorry":false,"statement_used_by":["Breakdown.SteadyCert.certificateWeakProfile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.fracCertificate_profile_chain"],"statement_uses":["Breakdown.FracCert.WeakRotatingProfileExists","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertificateHypothesis"],"used_by":["Breakdown.SteadyCert.ChainInternal.certificateWeakProfile_holds","Breakdown.SteadyCert.certificateWeakProfile","Breakdown.SteadyCert.fracCertificate_profile_chain"],"uses":["Breakdown.FracCert.WeakRotatingProfileExists","Breakdown.SteadyCert.FracCertificateHypothesis"],"written":"CertificateWeakProfileStatement"}],"imports":["Breakdown.FracCert.StFree","Breakdown.FracCert.StWeak","Breakdown.Held.Statements"],"module":"Breakdown.FracCert.StHeld","path":"Breakdown/FracCert/StHeld.lean","sha256":"ccb033214990839b8e4a94e731cca0d9217bba29f2130aed0ba6ed49678c4e11","source":"import Breakdown.FracCert.StFree\nimport Breakdown.FracCert.StWeak\nimport Breakdown.Held.Statements\n\nopen scoped ContDiff ENNReal\nopen MeasureTheory Matrix\n\nnoncomputable section\n\nnamespace Breakdown\n\nnamespace SteadyCert\n\nnamespace FracCertData\n\nvariable {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N)\n\ndef fullField (α : ℝ) (p : Fin k → ℝ) (v : Space → Space) (G : Space → (Space →L[ℝ] Space))\n    (H : Space → (Space →L[ℝ] Space →L[ℝ] Space)) (P : Space → Space) (κ : Fin k → ℝ) (y : Space) : Space :=\n  d.localField α p v G H κ y + d.splitField P H y\n\nstructure IsLinearState (α : ℝ) (p : Fin k → ℝ) (v : Space → Space) (G : Space → (Space →L[ℝ] Space))\n    (H : Space → (Space →L[ℝ] Space →L[ℝ] Space)) (P : Space → Space) : Prop where\n  second : IsSecondOrderField d.order v G H\n  power : IsWeakFractionalPower α v P\n  drift : MemLp (driftField α (d.rotationRate p) v G) 2 volume\n\nstructure IsHeldSolution (α : ℝ) (p : Fin k → ℝ) (u : Space → Space) (G : Space → (Space →L[ℝ] Space))\n    (H : Space → (Space →L[ℝ] Space →L[ℝ] Space)) (P : Space → Space) (κ : Fin k → ℝ) : Prop where\n  state : d.IsLinearState α p u G H P\n  equation : ∃ Q : Space → Space, IsGradientField Q ∧\n    ∀ᵐ y ∂volume, d.fullField α p u G H P κ y + G y (u y) + d.defect α p y + Q y = 0\n  pins : ∀ i, d.pins G i = 0\n\ndef heldMultiplier (p : Fin k → ℝ) (κ : Fin k → ℝ) : Fin k → ℝ := fun i => d.multiplier p i + κ i\n\nend FracCertData\n\ndef AprioriBoundStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d →\n    ∀ p ∈ box d.radius, ∀ v G H P, d.IsLinearState α p v G H P → ∀ κ : Fin k → ℝ,\n      d.size G H κ ≤ d.boundFn (projectedNorm (d.fullField α p v G H P κ))\n        (Real.sqrt (d.rowsModGrad (d.fullField α p v G H P κ) ^ 2 + d.pinWeight * vecNorm (d.pins G) ^ 2)) 0\n\ndef LinearSolveStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d →\n    ∀ p ∈ box d.radius, ∀ F : Space → Space, MemLp F 2 volume → IsClassField d.order F →\n    ∀ z : Fin k → ℝ, ∃ v G H P, ∃ κ : Fin k → ℝ, d.IsLinearState α p v G H P ∧\n      (∃ Q : Space → Space, IsGradientField Q ∧ ∀ᵐ y ∂volume, d.fullField α p v G H P κ y = F y + Q y) ∧\n      ∀ i, d.pins G i = z i\n\ndef HeldExistsStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d →\n    ∀ p ∈ box d.radius, ∃ u G H P, ∃ κ : Fin k → ℝ, d.IsHeldSolution α p u G H P κ ∧\n      d.size G H κ ≤ d.heldRadius\n\ndef HeldUniqueStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d →\n    ∀ p ∈ box d.radius, ∀ u G H P κ u' G' H' P' κ', d.IsHeldSolution α p u G H P κ →\n      d.IsHeldSolution α p u' G' H' P' κ' →\n      (Real.sqrt (d.energy G H) + Real.sqrt (d.energy G' H')) * (d.rowConst * d.productConst) < 1 →\n      (∀ᵐ y ∂volume, u y = u' y) ∧ κ = κ'\n\ndef HeldMultiplierContinuousStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d →\n    ∃ Φ : (Fin k → ℝ) → Fin k → ℝ, ContinuousOn Φ (box d.radius) ∧ ∀ p ∈ box d.radius,\n      ∃ u G H P, d.IsHeldSolution α p u G H P (fun i => Φ p i - d.multiplier p i) ∧\n        d.size G H (fun i => Φ p i - d.multiplier p i) ≤ d.heldRadius\n\ndef ActiveEnclosureStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d →\n    ∀ p ∈ d.testBox, ∀ u G H P κ, d.IsHeldSolution α p u G H P κ → d.size G H κ ≤ d.heldRadius →\n      ∀ j ∈ d.activeSet, |(d.frameᵀ *ᵥ d.heldMultiplier p κ) j - d.slope j * p j| ≤ |d.slope j| * d.radius j\n\ndef StiffEnclosureStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d →\n    ∀ p ∈ d.testBox, ∀ u G H P κ, d.IsHeldSolution α p u G H P κ → d.size G H κ ≤ d.heldRadius →\n      ∑ j ∈ d.activeSetᶜ, ((d.frameᵀ *ᵥ d.heldMultiplier p κ) j - d.slope j * p j) ^ 2 ≤ d.ellipsoidRadius ^ 2\n\ndef TestBoxSubsetStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d → d.testBox ⊆ box d.radius\n\ndef HeldZeroStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d →\n    ∃ p ∈ box d.radius, ∃ u G H P, ∃ κ : Fin k → ℝ, d.IsHeldSolution α p u G H P κ ∧\n      d.size G H κ ≤ d.heldRadius ∧ d.heldMultiplier p κ = 0\n\ndef HeldNonzeroStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d →\n    ∀ p ∈ box d.radius, ∀ u G H P κ, d.IsHeldSolution α p u G H P κ → d.size G H κ ≤ d.heldRadius →\n      ¬ (∀ᵐ y ∂volume, d.profile p y + u y = 0)\n\ndef HeldWeakProfileStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → ∀ {k N : ℕ} (d : FracCertData k N), IsFracCert α d →\n    ∀ p ∈ box d.radius, ∀ u G H P κ, d.IsHeldSolution α p u G H P κ → d.size G H κ ≤ d.heldRadius →\n      d.heldMultiplier p κ = 0 → FracCert.WeakRotatingProfileExists α\n\ndef CertificateWeakProfileStatement : Prop :=\n  ∀ α : ℝ, 1 < α → α < 5 / 4 → FracCertificateHypothesis α → FracCert.WeakRotatingProfileExists α\n\nend SteadyCert\n\nend Breakdown\n"}